@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
participant "d:DeleteCommand" as DeleteCommand LOGIC_COLOR
participant "m:Model" as Model MODEL_COLOR

[-> DeleteCommand : execute(m)
DeleteCommand -> Model : getFilteredPersonList()
Model --> DeleteCommand : lastShownList
note over DeleteCommand, Model
  Reject repeated or out-of-range indices.
  Capture all targets from the original displayed list.
end note
DeleteCommand -> Model : getAddressBook()
Model --> DeleteCommand : currentAddressBook
DeleteCommand -> DeleteCommand : previousState = new AddressBook(currentAddressBook)
loop For each captured contact
  DeleteCommand -> Model : deletePerson(personToDelete)
end
DeleteCommand -> DeleteCommand : format feedback in input order
DeleteCommand -> Model : commitAddressBook(previousState, message)
DeleteCommand -->[ : CommandResult(message)
@enduml
